{"parentUuid":"5f7ecde5-d642-47bd-b80f-b767c524e064","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_017vBNYefigSnv7RznzhUAtt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01RpFHCRDZdxcH18CcVpdXMy","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/format-entire-explain/.superpowers/brainstorm/48632-1777537710/no-prompt-options.html","content":"<h2>The \"(no prompt)\" replacement &mdash; pick one</h2>\n<p class=\"subtitle\">Same three sample checkpoints rendered three ways. Click the option you prefer.</p>\n\n<style>\n  .term {\n    background: #0d1117;\n    color: #c9d1d9;\n    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    padding: 14px 18px;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    white-space: pre;\n    overflow-x: auto;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .term .dim    { color: #6e7681; }\n  .term .bold   { color: #f0f6fc; font-weight: 600; }\n  .term .orange { color: #fb923c; }\n  .term .yellow { color: #d4a72c; }\n  .term .green  { color: #56d364; }\n  .term .gray   { color: #8b949e; }\n  .term .quoted { color: #a5d6ff; }\n  .term .strike { text-decoration: line-through; opacity: 0.5; }\n  .scenario-label {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.06em;\n    color: #6e7681;\n    margin: 6px 0 4px;\n    font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;\n  }\n  .options .option .content { width: 100%; }\n  .options .option h3 { margin-top: 0; }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"options\">\n\n  <div class=\"option\" data-choice=\"alpha\" onclick=\"toggleSelect(this)\">\n    <div class=\"letter\">A</div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <h3>Option α &mdash; always fall back to latest commit message</h3>\n      <p class=\"subtitle\">Empty prompt &rarr; surface the most recent commit subject in that group as the headline.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"scenario-label\">Scenario 1: normal checkpoint with a prompt</div>\n<pre class=\"term\"><span class=\"orange\">●</span> <span class=\"bold\">a3b2c4d5e6f7</span>  <span class=\"quoted\">\"add explain --generate flag\"</span>\n  <span class=\"dim\">04-30 14:22</span>  <span class=\"dim\">e7f1a90</span>  feat(cli): add --generate flag\n  <span class=\"dim\">04-30 14:18</span>  <span class=\"dim\">b21c0fa</span>  refactor(cli): split explain header</pre>\n\n      <div class=\"scenario-label\">Scenario 2: task checkpoint, no SessionPrompt</div>\n<pre class=\"term\"><span class=\"orange\">●</span> <span class=\"bold\">9c1f2a3b4d5e</span>  <span class=\"dim\">[Task]</span>  feat(cli): wire up paging\n  <span class=\"dim\">04-30 14:05</span>  <span class=\"dim\">d11abcd</span>  feat(cli): wire up paging</pre>\n\n      <div class=\"scenario-label\">Scenario 3: hook-only checkpoint, no prompt, no commit</div>\n<pre class=\"term\"><span class=\"orange\">●</span> <span class=\"bold\">temporary   </span>  <span class=\"dim\">[temporary]</span>  <span class=\"dim\">&mdash;</span>\n  <span class=\"dim\">04-30 13:58</span>  <span class=\"dim\">3f0aa11</span>  Checkpoint: 9c1f2a3b4d5e</pre>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"option\" data-choice=\"beta\" onclick=\"toggleSelect(this)\">\n    <div class=\"letter\">B</div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <h3>Option β &mdash; differentiate task vs no-prompt-captured</h3>\n      <p class=\"subtitle\">Task checkpoints surface task description; otherwise dimmed <code>(no prompt recorded)</code>.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"scenario-label\">Scenario 1: normal checkpoint with a prompt</div>\n<pre class=\"term\"><span class=\"orange\">●</span> <span class=\"bold\">a3b2c4d5e6f7</span>  <span class=\"quoted\">\"add explain --generate flag\"</span>\n  <span class=\"dim\">04-30 14:22</span>  <span class=\"dim\">e7f1a90</span>  feat(cli): add --generate flag\n  <span class=\"dim\">04-30 14:18</span>  <span class=\"dim\">b21c0fa</span>  refactor(cli): split explain header</pre>\n\n      <div class=\"scenario-label\">Scenario 2: task checkpoint, no SessionPrompt</div>\n<pre class=\"term\"><span class=\"orange\">●</span> <span class=\"bold\">9c1f2a3b4d5e</span>  <span class=\"dim\">[Task]</span>  <span class=\"quoted\">\"refactor explain.go split\"</span>\n  <span class=\"dim\">04-30 14:05</span>  <span class=\"dim\">d11abcd</span>  feat(cli): wire up paging</pre>\n\n      <div class=\"scenario-label\">Scenario 3: hook-only checkpoint, no prompt, no commit</div>\n<pre class=\"term\"><span class=\"orange\">●</span> <span class=\"bold\">temporary   </span>  <span class=\"dim\">[temporary]</span>  <span class=\"dim\">(no prompt recorded)</span>\n  <span class=\"dim\">04-30 13:58</span>  <span class=\"dim\">3f0aa11</span>  Checkpoint: 9c1f2a3b4d5e</pre>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"option\" data-choice=\"gamma\" onclick=\"toggleSelect(this)\">\n    <div class=\"letter\">C</div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <h3>Option γ &mdash; cascade (prompt &rarr; first commit message &rarr; dimmed placeholder)</h3>\n      <p class=\"subtitle\">Best of both. Collapses the indented commit list when the headline already shows the same text.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"scenario-label\">Scenario 1: normal checkpoint with a prompt</div>\n<pre class=\"term\"><span class=\"orange\">●</span> <span class=\"bold\">a3b2c4d5e6f7</span>  <span class=\"quoted\">\"add explain --generate flag\"</span>\n  <span class=\"dim\">04-30 14:22</span>  <span class=\"dim\">e7f1a90</span>  feat(cli): add --generate flag\n  <span class=\"dim\">04-30 14:18</span>  <span class=\"dim\">b21c0fa</span>  refactor(cli): split explain header</pre>\n\n      <div class=\"scenario-label\">Scenario 2: task checkpoint, no SessionPrompt &mdash; commit list collapsed (would duplicate)</div>\n<pre class=\"term\"><span class=\"orange\">●</span> <span class=\"bold\">9c1f2a3b4d5e</span>  <span class=\"dim\">[Task]</span>  feat(cli): wire up paging\n  <span class=\"dim\">04-30 14:05</span>  <span class=\"dim\">d11abcd</span>  <span class=\"dim\">(same as above)</span></pre>\n\n      <div class=\"scenario-label\">Scenario 3: hook-only checkpoint, no prompt, no commit</div>\n<pre class=\"term\"><span class=\"orange\">●</span> <span class=\"bold\">temporary   </span>  <span class=\"dim\">[temporary]</span>  <span class=\"dim\">(no prompt recorded)</span>\n  <span class=\"dim\">04-30 13:58</span>  <span class=\"dim\">3f0aa11</span>  Checkpoint: 9c1f2a3b4d5e</pre>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\" style=\"margin-top: 24px\">\n  <p class=\"label\">notes</p>\n  <p>All three keep the styled <code>●</code> bullet + bold ID headline that the detail view uses, so the list now shares the brand look. The only difference between them is what fills the headline when no user prompt was captured.</p>\n  <p><strong>The collapse behavior in γ</strong> is opt-in &mdash; it only triggers when there's exactly one commit AND the headline equals its message, so the user doesn't lose the date/sha when the data differs.</p>\n</div>\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1504,"cache_read_input_tokens":107676,"output_tokens":3142,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1504,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":6,"output_tokens":3142,"cache_read_input_tokens":107676,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1504,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1504},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CaZfTJ6h6HJRqQ873LtKG","type":"assistant","uuid":"f1576f13-b7e8-4734-be2a-d341bb33cf40","timestamp":"2026-04-30T08:47:03.737Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/format-entire-explain","